      "id": "get-extended-action-menu-filters",
      "name": "GetExtendedActionMenuFilters",
      "category": "BlueprintGraphModule",
      "signature": "GetExtendedActionMenuFilters(Target)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FBlueprintGraphModule*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "TArray<FActionMenuRejectionTest>&",
      "docs": "Provides access to a list of additional rejection tests that will be\nutilized when constructing Blueprint context/action menus. Helpful to\ngame modules, so they can inject their own custom filtering (and hide\noptions that may be undesired for their specific project).\nThese rejection tests will be ran after all the standard filter tests,\nand in the order that they are in this array.\n@return An array of additional rejection tests for FBlueprintActionFilter."
    },
